    },
    {
        "text": "You don't look so good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm old, so old... phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened to your hand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I couldn't dodge. That's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do we do now? Should we go to the shelter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No news from the mine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "None.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never thought we'd hold out this long... but we're almost to the end of the road.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
