        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Making a shield. I always wanted to try, actually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a trip down memory lane. Back to the glorious good old days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "The young rangers all gathered at the edge of town.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "Knowing the overwhelming odds stacked against them, knowing most would spill their blood in the wasteland after the war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they laughed and sang war songs, as if they were facing down bugs to be easily squashed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "War is cruel, and merciless. Some backed down. Many more held the line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fallen became legends. The survivors were tasked with remembering them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the last one standing in that bloodbath, after all that time, started to feel the fear of death set in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because he doesn't want the dead to be forgotten?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha... maybe that's why.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been an honor to fight alongside you, Alexsandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The honor is mine, Rangers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "But don't be so gloomy. I haven't given up the fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll smash a few to death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
