    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I picked up a Rhodes Island distress signal and figured it was a normal rescue mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't think I'd run into you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$normal02_intro",
        "key": "$normal02_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Old Ranger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're back in business, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, at my age? You're making fun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What about your sword, Ranger?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm too old. I haven't been able to swing it for years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it weren't for you, today would be the end of these old bones.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You sell yourself short, Old Ranger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up, squad. The objective is the Lord's manor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "text": "The enemy is an extremely dangerous form of Originium organism.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep your location updated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
